cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use pelicode, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "pelicode: Know where your code came from"
abstract: >-
  pelicode extracts functions with Tree-sitter, normalizes and hashes them,
  stores the features of published open-source packages in a database without
  their source code, and reports similar code candidates to review, with their
  sources and licenses.
authors:
  - family-names: Tamada
    given-names: Haruaki
    affiliation: Kyoto Sangyo University
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1838-9184"
repository-code: https://github.com/tamada/pelicode
url: https://tamada.github.io/pelicode/
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - code provenance
  - code clone detection
  - software theft
  - license compliance
  - tree-sitter
